备20GHz以上毫米波/射频/MMIC芯片架构设计实战经验，技术具备业界领先性；\n3. 基础能力：CET-6及以上，可熟练阅读英文文献、开展英文技术交流。\n二、核心硬核能力\n1. 架构与模块设计：精通相控阵、微波RFIC整体架构&技术具备领先性，了解抗辐照设计需求，熟练设计PA、LNA、Mixer、移相器等核心射频模块，擅长宽带、高线性、高效率、高集成芯片设计；\n2. 工艺能力：熟悉SiGe、SOI、GaAs、GaN主流射频工艺，具备Foundry流片对接、精通器件特性、工艺调试与问题排查能力，了解抗辐照工艺需求；\n3. 全流程研发：熟练使用ADS、Cadence、HFSS等EDA工具，精通芯片设计、版图、电磁/数模混合仿真，掌握器件建模、寄生提取、去嵌入核心技术；\n4. 测试闭环能力：熟练射频仪器与片上测试，可独立制定高频测试方案，精准排查仿真与测试偏差，完成研发迭代闭环；\n5. 技术攻关：可解决高频模型准确性、优化高频系统芯片设计方法论、解决关键卡点、MMIC非线性、宽带设计等进阶技术。\n三、优先加分项\n1. 有相控阵雷达、5G毫米波、微波UDC、卫星通信BFIC等流片/量产经验优先；\n2. 拥有ISSCC、JSSC等顶会顶刊论文或核心技术专利优先；\n3. 具备技术路线规划、射频IP库搭建、团队技术赋能经验优先；\n4. 有行业标准制定、高端学术交流经验优先。\n四、综合素质特质\n扎实的电磁场与数理功底，技术创新与攻坚能力突出，具备前沿技术视野；抗压自驱、擅长跨部门协作，兼具工程落地、技术体系搭建与团队赋能能力。","ClassificationOne":"研发","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"硕士研究生","YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-03T13:53:24","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdName